<object id="legend-content" label="Solid arrows: application calls / replication; arrowhead points to the recipient. Normal responses return on the same application path.&lt;br&gt;Dashed arrow A: auxiliary DNS query. B2/B3/B5 branches select an origin or target; they do not broadcast.&lt;br&gt;Orange dashed enclosure: one Auto Scaling group across AZs (logical membership, not a network boundary). Blue dashed enclosure: AZ.&lt;br&gt;Multiple = representative server set; exact counts/capacities are unspecified. [unspecified] = protocol not supplied. ELB = Elastic Load Balancer."><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fontColor=#233247;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1790" width="1400" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
